cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use DrivAerRim, please cite the dataset and the source DeepWheel
  collection. Also cite the accompanying DrivAerRim article when its formal
  publication identifier becomes available.
title: >-
  DrivAerRim: A full vehicle dataset with rotating wheels for data-driven
  aerodynamic design of wheel rims
type: dataset
authors:
