    affiliation: Tongji University
  - family-names: Yang
    given-names: Zhigang
    affiliation: Tongji University
date-released: "2026-07-07"
url: https://huggingface.co/datasets/BeyondXia1212/DrivAerRim
license: CC-BY-NC-4.0
abstract: >-
  DrivAerRim is a full vehicle computational fluid dynamics dataset that
  isolates the aerodynamic effects of rim geometry. It contains steady RANS
  simulations of 904 non-parametric DeepWheel rim geometries installed on a
  fixed, full scale DrivAer estateback. Rim rotation is represented using
  moving reference frame regions and tyre rotation using rotating wall
  boundary conditions. The release contains geometry, integrated aerodynamic
  coefficients, accumulated drag, surface pressure and wall shear stress,
  prescribed slices, local wheel volumes, a wake volume, a volume surrounding
  the complete vehicle, preview images, and convergence histories.
keywords:
  - computational fluid dynamics
  - automotive aerodynamics
  - rim aerodynamics
  - wheel aerodynamics
  - Reynolds-averaged Navier-Stokes
  - moving reference frame
  - geometric deep learning
  - surrogate modelling
